    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "speaker": "Learner",
      "text": "Perfect. So I do slides one to six tonight, you do seven to twelve tomorrow morning, and we check everything tomorrow evening."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "speaker": "Partner",
      "text": "That makes sense. I'll send you a message when my part's ready."
    }
